src/font_data.h contains the 7x12 bitmap font from 0dan0's Kodak Reels project
(https://github.com/0dan0/4reels). It is the font table at 0x8033A800 in that
project's firmware images, which its MIT-licensed hist module renders with. The
project's modules are distributed under this licence:

